# The first oracle that plays (PLAN.md block 6): a name typed and confirmed (A, then one
# position back to the DONE glyph — eight detents a position), NEW GAME from the main menu, the
# first level with the ball in play and nothing touching it, and the GAME OVER that follows.
3000: select
3300: select
3600: wheel -8
3900: shot
4000: select
4300: shot
4600: select
4900: shot
5200: select
5500: shot
6500: shot
6500: quit
